00:00:00,095 --> 00:00:06,735
Takko: start with an idea in your own words. This is a UI walkthrough, with no model call.

2
00:00:06,735 --> 00:00:10,807
Models is your reusable library. Add a provider and model once.

3
00:00:10,807 --> 00:00:17,390
Choose a provider, pick from its catalog, and enter the API key locally.

4
00:00:17,390 --> 00:00:23,968
Presets keep the model roles and spending limits together for reuse.

5
00:00:23,968 --> 00:00:30,524
Creating the project saves your idea. Shape my idea is the separate model action.

6
00:00:30,524 --> 00:00:40,640
Then review choices, answer or delegate, and approve the direction before planning. The next segment shows the paid run.
